  "execution_contract_source": "The source-authored six-case table is independent of this census. After each real available_engines invocation reaches all engine/order/capability assertions, the carrier appends ENGINE-001..006 to engine-observations.json when REVAYAT_ENGINE_EVENT_DIR is supplied by an outer owner. No journal row is generated from census inventory or carrier outcome. Outer capture must validate successful carrier and finalize cleanup before publishing an engine OperationReport in each existing portable scope."
